### Azure Functions Test Requests
### Use this file with VS Code REST Client extension

# Variables
@functionAppUrl = https://func-fdev-weu-prd.azurewebsites.net
@apiKey = Iiu4FGldYIycjovf6X8bJn93lf6ZAJWv

### Health Check (No authentication required)
GET {{functionAppUrl}}/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

### Get SAS Upload URL (Requires API key)
POST {{functionAppUrl}}/api/get-sas-upload
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "fileName": "test-backup.zip",
    "expirationHours": 1
}

### Alternative with function key (if you have one)
# POST {{functionAppUrl}}/api/get-sas-upload?code=YOUR_FUNCTION_KEY_HERE
# Content-Type: application/json
# X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

# {
#     "fileName": "test-backup.zip", 
#     "expirationHours": 1
# }
